/-!
# The 25 characteristic candidates in checked coordinates

Positive words identify each finite subgroup mask with its exact published
representative. Kernel membership is identified using the existing bijective
Sylow and transfer enumerations. No subgroup census is assumed.

Source: the finite characteristic branch for Huppert--Blackburn III,
XII.1.18(b), printed p.314. Tables are generated by `source/generate.py`.
-/

